<title>USA: Say Yes says dairy foods okayed in Canada.</title>
<headline>Say Yes says dairy foods okayed in Canada.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Say Yes Foods Inc said on Tuesday it has been given approval to sell its dairy products in Canada and it is now distributing Say Yes Eggnog to 20 supermarkets in British Columbia.</p>
<p>In January, Say Yes Foods will be marketing its line of Dairy products to an additional 300 outlets in British Columbia.</p>
</text>
